    "narration": "Three out of four teams gave up and went back to a paid API within a quarter.",
    "sourceStart": 19.0,
    "sourceEnd": 26.0
  },
  {
    "scene": 2,
    "narration": "The first mistake is benchmarking the model instead of benchmarking the pipeline.",
    "sourceStart": 58.2,
    "sourceEnd": 65.0
  },
  {
    "scene": 3,
    "narration": "On an eight gigabyte card, memory is the whole game: weights plus KV cache.",
    "sourceStart": 101.0,
    "sourceEnd": 108.0
  },
  {
    "scene": 4,
    "narration": "Structured output support is a property of the endpoint, not of the model.",
    "sourceStart": 199.0,
    "sourceEnd": 206.0
  },
  {
    "scene": 5,
    "narration": "Free catalogues rotate, so a hardcoded model identifier is a time bomb.",
    "sourceStart": 297.5,
    "sourceEnd": 304.0
  },
  {
    "scene": 6,
    "narration": "Nobody measures quality in their own language, and English leaderboards do not transfer.",
    "sourceStart": 325.5,
    "sourceEnd": 333.0
  },
  {
    "scene": 7,
    "narration": "Build a ladder: a primary, a secondary, and a local floor that never fully stops.",
    "sourceStart": 484.5,
    "sourceEnd": 492.0
  }
